{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-02_beg","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-02","title":"一些誤會","storyCode":"6-2","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"c4f1562cc80d09e0dee030848e30ad92a47dd3522c29cfcaade737eee019d661","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"咦......Rosmontis，你在做什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我想修好這個攜帶式終端。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"六年前到去年的記憶我都記在這裡了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"今天早上，我想讀六月十二號記錄的時候，螢幕突然就不亮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"如果......如果真的再讀不了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"三月十四號和爸爸去植物園，七月的登山，還有第四個四月，媽媽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......媽媽......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"別，別哭！那個啥，你不太擅長用電子螢幕對吧？\n為什麼不等Scout來幫你修一下呢？可露希爾也可以啊？\n我幫你拿給可露希爾吧，幾分鐘就搞定啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"Scout是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"是那個嗎，走路很輕的幹員嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"是他啊！有印象嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"給人很乾淨的感覺......像白色的瓷磚一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"他就在那。"},{"type":"narration","text":"......啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"從沒聽過你對我的評價，現在才知道，原來我感受起來是這麼脆弱。"},{"type":"narration","text":"你什麼時候來的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"可以說是一直都在。我習慣隱藏自己了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"Scout先生他確實一直都在的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼煌沒有感覺到呢？"},{"type":"narration","text":"......我是比較粗線條，沒看到啦！\n不是，你聽她說了那麼久，怎麼不幫她修下啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，接下來我們有任務。我得花些精力校準武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"你可能要請可露希爾或是機械師Mechanist先生去解決了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"是那個，營救Dr.{@nickname}的任務嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"narration","text":"哦哦，你也來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"作為主要發起人之一，如果我自己都不去，羅德島精英幹員不是成了笑話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡綸怎麼回覆你的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"一樣的託辭。她不會參與。同往常一樣，她一直都和凱爾希站一邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"......你有沒有考慮過，現在可能不是最佳時機？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"但這也可能是我們最後的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"為了躲避這次天災，切爾諾伯格很可能會在駛離這裡後，轉向烏薩斯腹地。在烏薩斯內部展開營救，成功的機率趨近於零。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"聽你們說了那麼多回，這個Dr.{@nickname}真有那麼神奇嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"和阿米婭與凱爾希一樣神奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我見過博士嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。不過很快你就能見到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我也很想感受一下博士的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"很想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"你會的，小貓。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"對了，Ace。 你下轄小隊裡，有個叫灰喉的非患者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"這事我記得。她應該還在單獨艙室接受指導。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"煌，聽我一句。我帶著她幾個月了，她也許不太會表達，但絕對沒有惡意。"},{"type":"narration","text":"但她對我的隊員說：“我不知道你們感染者有多痛苦。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"我清楚。但她可能真的只是很疑惑，她想要去問這個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒資格要求幹員立即明白我們的處境，而且，灰喉從沒質疑過羅德島的命令。"},{"type":"narration","text":"其他我不管，我絕對不允許任何人侮辱我的隊員，更別說詆毀羅德島感染者們的奮鬥了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"不是現在。我知道你在克制怒意，但真的，不是現在。"},{"type":"narration","text":"她當著我的面這麼說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"大貓，冷靜些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"你也有任務在身。"},{"type":"narration","text":"......是啊。\n行吧，回來再處理。\n誰叫Ace資歷比我老呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦你開始用這種口氣說話，我就懷疑你是想戲弄別人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"她可能真的在取笑你。"},{"type":"narration","text":"他只要有兩天沒修鬍子，我就一定會覺得他資歷特別老。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"Ace，鬍子很硬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊。"},{"type":"narration","text":"哈哈哈。那我去幫她送東西了。我也有任務在身，先走啦。\n等我任務結束回來，我們再去好好喝一場吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"可別再喝得吐一地了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"Misery擦了兩小時地板，再讓他見那種場面，他恐怕也要吐出來。"},{"type":"narration","text":"誰知道你酒量那麼好啊！\nRosmontis，機械師等等就幫你把終端送過來。\n乖乖等著就好了，別把這件事忘了哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rosmontis","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我不會忘的！再見！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_026","isRemote":false,"text":"小心燙傷！"},{"type":"narration","text":"不會啦，自己的法術，我有分寸的啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_building_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎麼會變成你們先走一步？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Ace，灰喉這樣的非感染者，真的值得你去培育嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我們能得到多少信任，又能奉獻出多少信任？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"如果博士......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你要說什麼？！","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"要說你的壞話。當面說。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"如果博士已經來了，那就趕緊出來，別偷偷摸摸的，想躲在牆角不被發現是需要技術的。"}]},{"label":"如果我也不相信羅德島的話？","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就把你吊在電線杆上做整合運動的誘餌。放心！不會死的，也就多中幾箭吧，開個刀就好了！"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"唉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭讓你來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"好了別說了。她就這點最好，也就這點最不好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我時時想做些什麼提醒下她，讓她想想“她還只是個孩子”這種事......每每都適得其反。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"只要她還領導著羅德島，是不是就不可能把她那個小大人架子放下來？哎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，如果不是阿米婭讓你來，而是你主動要來陪我什麼的，我是不會反感的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......拖後腿？放心吧，帶著三個你我都能行動自如，別說只有一個Dr.{@nickname}了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你看那邊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_building_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不走！你們走啊！我們不想打了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......我們不會向感染者屈服！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們就幾個人，為什麼要這麼做，有什麼好處！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是職責！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那就不要怪我們下手狠了！你沒看到我們背後那些怪物嗎！快點逃啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪有什麼怪物？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_building_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"看到那批正在穿小巷的整合運動沒？他們好像在進攻龍門人的陣線欸。那幾個龍門人應該撐不太久......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"給我規劃條路線吧。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"正常的還是......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"當然是最快的啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"別那個表情嘛。扛著你跳上跳下，這也不是第一次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"好！把那群整合運動揍趴下，順帶幫一把那些龍門人吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace","Scout"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]}]}
